WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.780
- In the morning during the work week,

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:04.010
I usually wake up around 7:00 a.m.

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.360
and then slowly get myself ready for work.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.478
I'm grateful for my wife who
usually prepares breakfast

00:00:10.478 --> 00:00:11.754
for me in the morning.

00:00:11.754 --> 00:00:14.740
She's a bit more of a
morning person than I am,

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.757
so she wakes up already a bit earlier,

00:00:16.757 --> 00:00:18.119
gets everything ready,

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:21.400
and then often also joins
me for the breakfast.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.340
And, of course, black coffee is very much

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.910
appreciated as well.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.240
I then get myself ready, grab my bag,

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.663
and leave the house towards my work.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:34.500
I live in Munich, and my
work is in Munich as well,

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:38.216
so it's a short commute that
I do every day to get there.

00:00:38.216 --> 00:00:41.900
Usually I take the bicycle,
but recently it got stolen.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.970
So at the moment, I take
the S-Bahn and the U-Bahn

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:46.975
to get to work, so public transit,

00:00:46.975 --> 00:00:50.414
which takes me about 20
minutes every day to get there,

00:00:50.414 --> 00:00:52.980
and then 20 minutes to get back as well.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.000
I work for Building Radar,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.546
which is a young property
technology company.

00:00:56.546 --> 00:01:00.620
And our mission is to digitalize
the construction industry.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.100
So as it's Monday morning,

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.462
I'm having a weekly check-in with my team.

00:01:04.462 --> 00:01:07.530
I'm responsible for the
sales and the marketing team,

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.640
where everybody just
gives an update on what

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:11.960
their priorities for the week are,

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.020
just to create alignment in the team.

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:15.610
So, welcome to another coffee break

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:17.460
here on my channel, Firm Learning.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.780
Hope you're enjoying
following me around for a day.

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:21.980
I must say this day is
rather representative

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:23.510
of how it usually goes.

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:25.990
Here we are at the
office of Building Radar.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:27.470
I started with this company

00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:30.110
as a chief revenue
officer earlier this year.

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:31.830
And actually, if you're interested to join

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:32.840
the team as well,

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.680
Building Radar is currently
hiring for several positions.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.350
You need to be based in Munich, though.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:39.640
I will insert a link to
their career page below

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:40.950
in the video description.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.910
In the meantime, I write some
emails and get some work done,

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:45.917
just in an effort to try to use the time

00:01:45.917 --> 00:01:49.370
in between meetings as
efficiently as possible.

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:51.720
So as we are rather
young company, of course,

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:55.030
an occasionally the table
football match cannot be missing.

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:56.774
We do this quite regularly in the breaks,

00:01:56.774 --> 00:01:59.473
and what I enjoy even more
is probably table tennis,

00:01:59.473 --> 00:02:02.640
but most of the time used for meetings.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.740
There are many lunch
options around the office.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.530
So today we decided to
go for a Shavasana plate,

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:08.800
which I liked quite a lot.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.680
We enjoyed it outside in the sun

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:12.920
before then heading back to the office.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:17.520
And of course refreshing us
with a nice black coffee.

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:18.900
I love to drink lots of coffee.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:22.510
So often just diluted with the
water just to make sure I do

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:23.920
not drink too much,

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:26.700
because otherwise I would be
able to drink several cups

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:29.490
every day, which is of
course not very healthy.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:31.650
After lunch, I meet the marketing team.

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:34.460
We are currently discussing
some new lead nurturing

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:36.330
strategies we want to implement.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.790
So we're sitting in front of
the PC because several members

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:40.650
are dialed in from the home office.

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:41.950
And then after this meeting,

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.630
I met together with another
colleague and we were discussing

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:46.169
some strategies for our events,

00:02:46.169 --> 00:02:49.170
so webinars and other
events that we are planning

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.058
for the rest of the year

00:02:50.058 --> 00:02:52.810
to get us on track on the marketing side.

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.850
After that I'm meeting
one of the co-founders

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:57.600
of Building Radar and we are
reviewing some high-level

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.340
business numbers on the
marketing and sales side,

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:03.090
and also discussing some
strategic initiatives

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:06.160
that will be now focus for
us over the next weeks.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.193
After that it's time to get
home using public transit,

00:03:09.193 --> 00:03:12.700
I usually then sit together
with my wife in the evenings

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.000
to have some dinner.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.150
And then afterwards,

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:16.948
it's time to go back to the desk,

00:03:16.948 --> 00:03:20.506
get some additional
emails and paperwork done.

00:03:20.506 --> 00:03:22.660
The evenings is often also the time

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.410
I use for my Firm Learning work.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:28.380
So indeed I was editing this
very video that I was filming

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:29.280
during the day.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.640
So after that, I was going back
to answer even more emails,

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:34.230
many of them also from you,

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.760
but then it's time to call
it a day and just go to bed.

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.110
So hope this was interesting.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.970
Please like if you enjoyed the
video and leave me a comment,

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:44.060
whether you want to see
more content like that,

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.465
This is Heinrich from Firm Learning

00:03:45.465 --> 00:03:46.353
Good night.

